1. honest-thumbnails
   Source:  https://github.com/hiyanyang/honest-thumbnails
   Copyright (c) hiyanyang
   License: MIT

   Derived portion — content/youtube.js, specifically the frame-resolution
   strategy: requesting maxres{1,2,3}.jpg and falling back to hq{1,2,3}.jpg,
   treating the 120x90 placeholder image as "no frame available" instead of
   trusting the HTTP status, and skipping vertical Shorts thumbnails.

   The rest of this repository is original work: the Bilibili adapter, the
   Douyin adapter, the shared scan / prefetch / queue / cache / restore engine,
   the popup interface, and the icons.
